# Vercel turns every file under api/ into its own serverless function — except
# ones whose name or parent directory starts with an underscore, which is why
# the shared helpers live in `api/_lib/`. The Hobby plan allows **12 functions
# per deployment**; with the helpers counted this project sat at exactly 12 and
# the next endpoint added broke the build (docs/wounds.md, 2026-09-21).
#
# The colocated unit tests at the api/ root still need excluding: without this
# each would deploy as a route (/api/battle-turn.test) that imports vitest at
# runtime, and each would count against that limit.
api/**/*.test.js
